    "prompt": "Another experiment with Seedance 2.5 #Seedance25 , a 30 second cinematic inspired by the Mahabharata, created from a single prompt.\n\n@dreamina_ai\n\n#AIVideo #AIFilmmaking #GenerativeAI #Mahabharata #Animation #Storytelling",
